  "prefLabel": "Per 801.01 Types of Evaluation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 801.01 Types of Evaluation. An employee's current supervisor shall evaluate the performance of each employee in a full-time classified position using a written evaluation applicable to the employee’s job function, as specified in Per 801.02 through Per 801.05.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at chapter heading for Per 100) by #8738, eff 10-18-06; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15; ss by #14439, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES: 12-1-35",
